      "rationale": "Reduce 66% to 65.5% (-0.5 percentage point): halve the existing one-point upside premium because the fresh custom-order interviews reduce confidence in favorable share persistence. Direction is consistent with prior primary Trainium disclosures, but respondent independence and dollar shares are unverified. Size is my judgment; largely 2027 orders are not a measured 2026 share loss. Bull revenue falls $2.99bn (-0.76%) to $391.79bn; base, bear, capex, mix, concentration and AMD remain held.",
