      "interpretation": "AMD's August 4, 2026 Azure Helios deployment collaboration remains the dated customer anchor. The new neocloud availability observation is consistent with improving supply, but provides no new Microsoft GPU revenue estimate.",
      "uncertainty": "Neocloud availability is a different channel from Azure demand; it cannot establish MI450 recognized revenue, contracted share or Big Four concentration. AMD base remains near $14bn street.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source_id": "amd-2026-08-04-release",
          "quote": "Expanded collaboration with Microsoft to deploy AMD Helios racks at scale on Azure to power frontier model inference."
        },
        {
