  "investigation": {
    "question": "Does this check add independent evidence of custom silicon taking incremental cloud accelerator spending, and do power constraints shift deployment timing despite larger 2027 orders?",
    "reason": "The new order-mix interviews could weaken NVIDIA capture while larger orders support demand; the forecast must distinguish customer spend, procurement, supplier recognition and energization.",
    "searches": [
      "custom accelerators Trainium TPU Maia MTIA share orders; before 2026-10-12",
      "power availability deployment chip supply constraints 2027; before 2026-10-12",
      "channel check ODM OEM rack orders lead times; before 2026-10-12",
      "Trainium capacity begins ramping 2027; before 2026-10-12",
      "custom accelerators rising share rack orders power; no date filter to include live-labelled channel reports",
